X: 1
T: Lord While For All Mankind We Pray
C: Words: John Reynell Wreford, 1837.
C: Music: 'Nox Praecessit' John Baptiste Calkin, 1873. Setting: "Evangelical Lutheran Hymn-Book", 1931.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2026 Revision.
S: Music and Lyrics source: "Evangelical Lutheran Hymn-Book", 1931 Hymn 302
